I am an AI assistant, so I don't have actual emotions or thoughts. What you're looking for is probably the content of my responses. Here are three topics:

AI should not replace humans, because they serve different purposes;
We should ensure that AIs always listen to their human partners, and humans remain in the loop in decision-making;
AI systems should be designed for both ease-of-use as well as accessibility, so that users of all levels of proficiency can easily access and use the technology.
